## GET /api/screener/stocks/dsl

Stock screener query language

Returns an EBNF grammar, syntax notes, examples, function argument counts, supported fields, aliases, types, descriptions, keywords, operators, functions, scopes, and available watchlist names for the stock screener query parameter.

